"Cocaine runs /usr/bin/ssh with your ~/.ssh/config and keys, host keys always checked, nothing forwarded" = "Cocaine usa /usr/bin/ssh con tu ~/.ssh/config y tus claves, las claves de host siempre verificadas, nada reenviado";
